@Host = http://localhost:5294

### 1. Hatalı Ürün Ekle (Validation Testi - POST Command)
POST {{Host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50,
  "initialStock": -5
}

### 1.1 Geçerli Ürün Ekle (POST Command - Önbelleği Temizler)
POST {{Host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apple Magic Keyboard",
  "price": 4200,
  "initialStock": 15
}

### 2. Ürünleri Sayfala (GET Query - Sayfa 1, 2 Adet Ürün)
GET {{Host}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

### 2.1 Ürün Ara ve Sırala (Fiyata Göre Azalan - GET Query)
GET {{Host}}/api/products?searchTerm=Logitech&sortBy=price&isDescending=true
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Hatalı Sayfalama İsteği (Validation Testi - PageSize: 500)
GET {{Host}}/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=500
Accept: application/json

### 3. Sipariş Oluştur (POST Command)
POST {{Host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "2d88c9cc-d7a5-4f22-8768-44db5d89ebcd",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Sipariş Detayı Getir (GET Query)
GET {{Host}}/api/orders/89605202-b2e0-4581-a6df-39321c7d528d
Accept: application/json
